## Configuration

Main config file: `config/production.yaml`

Key sections:
- `webserver`: Domain, ports, HTTPS
- `database`: PostgreSQL connection
- `redis`: Redis connection
- `storage`: File paths
- `object_storage`: S3 configuration
- `transcoding`: Video encoding settings
- `live`: Live streaming settings
- `federation`: ActivityPub settings

